{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎゴルフ前回はいおりと2人でしたが\nこの間は久しぶりに4人で撮影できました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンエアぜひ見てね♪\n天気も良く、みんなといい意味で自由に楽しく撮影したよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前はドライバーで240ヤードちょっと出て嬉しかったけど今回の16はいろいろ苦戦しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も勉強になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんも昨日からお泊まりで四国にゴルフに行ってるみたいで、鳴門の渦潮の動画を送ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度お父さんともゴルフ行きたいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rの法則見てくれた〜？かわいいわんちゃんにいいこいいこしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと可愛すぎて収録後もまっすぐワンちゃんのとこ行って触らせてもらった( ˶ˆ꒳ˆ˵ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかちょっと大人っぽくない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ18歳になったからかな？えへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これねチョーカーしてるんだけど、この前初めてチョーカー買った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんもまなったんも最近よくメンバーつけてるからつけてみようかと思って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行ってるのかな？今時の流行りはメンバーから教えてもらいます‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも明るくムードメーカー でメンバー思いの ゆったんと\n可愛い仕草で声も素敵！しっかりみんなを引っ張ってくれる ひめちゃん！\nと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で着た服です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれてありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでも応援のメッセージありがとうございます！楽しんでもらえたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはとっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方も来てくださってありがとうございました！楽しかったです\nまたきてくださ〜いっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/05/0120568/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}